{"crc":"db5e6947","kind":"Candidate","payload":{"response":"Looking at the issue, the problem is that `pairplot` fails when `hue_order` doesn't contain all hue values. The error occurs in `seaborn/_core.py` (which is actually `seaborn/_oldcore.py` based on the files provided). \n\nThe issue is in the `HueMapping.categorical_mapping` method in `seaborn/_oldcore.py`. When a `hue_order` is specified that doesn't include all values in the data, the code should filter the data to only include those values, but instead it tries to create a mapping for all data values.\n\nLet me trace through the code to find where the fix should be applied. The `categorical_order` function is called in several places. The fix should be in the `PairGrid` class in `seaborn/axisgrid.py` where it handles the hue data filtering.\n\nLooking at the `PairGrid` class (which is truncated in the provided code), the issue is that when `hue_order` is specified, the data isn't being filtered to only include rows with hue values in `hue_order`. The fix should filter the data before plotting.\n\nLet me search for the relevant section in `axisgrid.py` where `PairGrid` handles hue data:\n\n# path: seaborn/axisgrid.py\n<<<<<<< SEARCH\n        # Determine the hue facet layer information\n        hue_var = hue\n        if hue is None:\n            hue_names = None\n        else:\n            hue_names = categorical_order(data[hue], hue_order)\n\n        colors = self._get_palette(data, hue, hue_order, palette)\n=======\n        # Determine the hue facet layer information\n        hue_var = hue\n        if hue is None:\n            hue_names = None\n        else:\n            hue_names = categorical_order(data[hue], hue_order)\n            # Filter data to only include specified hue levels\n            if hue_order is not None:\n                data = data.loc[data[hue].isin(hue_order)]\n\n        colors = self._get_palette(data, hue, hue_order, palette)\n>>>>>>> REPLACE","round":1,"slot":0},"producer":{"instance":"01KZQTWHJ3YPE0DT9GV9NT1952","kind":"drafter","parent":"01KZQTWHHYE3SP9S048WNAJ7TZ"},"schema":"Candidate@1","seq":14,"t":1786432621.0696661}
